1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,900
Hi, friends! I'm Mipo!

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,400
Look at my rainbow... Uh-oh!

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,900
One color is missing! Will you help me find it?

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:45,900
Yay! Let's go!

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:56,700
Good morning, Mipo! The sun is up, and the birds are singing.

6
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:00,400
Good morning, sunshine!

7
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,300
Oh no... where is the purple?

8
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:11,400
The purple stripe is gone. And look... the purple flowers are grey.

9
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:20,100
Mipo feels sad. That's okay. Everybody feels sad sometimes.

10
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:25,900
Let's take a big breath with Mipo. Smell the flower...

11
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,700
...and blow out the candle. One more time!

12
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:35,500
I feel a little better now.

13
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:40,200
Hello, Blue Bird. The rainbow lost its purple.

14
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:45,900
Tweet! Don't worry, Mipo. We can find it together!

15
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:55,900
Look! Mipo's magic wand is glowing!

16
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:05,400
A sparkle trail! It will show us the way!

17
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:10,900
Don't worry, rainbow. I'll bring your purple back!

18
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,400
Mipo feels brave now.

19
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:20,900
Are you ready, friends? Let's follow the sparkles!

20
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:35,700
Let's go!

21
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:41,700
Welcome to the Red Strawberry Garden! Everything here is... red!

22
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:45,700
Can you say red? ...Red!

23
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:51,300
Hi, Mipo! Do you want to help me pick strawberries?

24
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:55,200
Yes, please!

25
00:02:55,300 --> 00:03:05,400
Let's count them together! One... two... three... four... five!

26
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:09,400
Five yummy strawberries! Thank you, Mipo.

27
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:15,700
Bunny, have you seen the purple from the rainbow?

28
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:25,200
Hmm... I saw purple sparkles hopping over Pumpkin Hill!

29
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:28,100
Will you come with us?

30
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:30,900
Hop, hop... yes!

31
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:45,700
Now Mipo has two friends. Friends make adventures more fun!

32
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:50,900
This is Pumpkin Hill. What color are the pumpkins?

33
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:59,400
Orange!

34
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:05,700
Are you okay, Bunny? Take my hand.

35
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:10,300
Thank you, Mipo! You are a good friend.

36
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:16,400
Helping a friend feels warm and happy inside.

37
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:25,900
Whoa! Roll, pumpkin, roll!

38
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:45,400
Look! A purple sparkle! It went that way!

39
00:04:45,500 --> 00:04:49,400
Yellow, yellow, like the sun!

40
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:55,700
Can you find something yellow where you are?

41
00:04:55,800 --> 00:05:05,700
Hmm... the sunflowers are so tall. I can't see the sparkles!

42
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:15,900
Hello! I'm tall. Maybe I can help!

43
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:25,200
I see the sparkles! They are going into the Green Forest.

44
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:29,200
Thank you, Deer! Will you come too?

45
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:33,300
Yes! Let's take turns leading the way.

46
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:45,400
Taking turns is a kind thing to do.

47
00:05:45,500 --> 00:05:55,200
This is the Whispering Forest. Green leaves, green moss... green everywhere!

48
00:05:55,300 --> 00:06:01,300
It's a little dark in here... I feel a bit scared.

49
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:06,700
When we feel scared, we can hold a friend's hand.

50
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,700
We're right here, Mipo.

51
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:15,900
Together... I feel brave!

52
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:25,400
Look! The fireflies are lighting the way!

53
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:27,400
Hellooo!

54
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:37,900
...hellooo... Can you say hello with Mipo? Hellooo!

55
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:55,400
Tweet! The frog says a little purple drop went to the river!

56
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:59,900
Blue, blue... the river is blue!

57
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:05,200
And the sky is blue too!

58
00:07:05,300 --> 00:07:11,700
Let's count the stones as we hop! One... two... three...

59
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:15,400
...four... five... six!

60
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:25,900
Slow and careful. Good job, friends!

61
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:55,700
The sparkles go into that cave!

62
00:07:55,800 --> 00:08:05,900
The crystals here should be purple... but they are grey.

63
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:15,900
Shh... listen. Someone is crying.

64
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:25,400
I'm the purple. I felt so small... I thought nobody would miss me.

65
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:30,400
We missed you so much! The rainbow needs you!

66
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:35,900
Every color is important. And every friend is important too.

67
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,900
We need you!

68
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:40,900
You make the flowers pretty!

69
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:45,700
Tweet, tweet! Come home!

70
00:08:45,800 --> 00:09:05,700
Really? Okay! Let's go home!

71
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:15,200
Mipo and his friends climb to the top of Rainbow Hill.

72
00:09:15,300 --> 00:09:18,200
Are you ready, Little Purple?

73
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:19,900
Ready!

74
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:25,200
Friends at home, count with me!

75
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:30,500
Three... two... one!

76
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:35,900
MAGIC!

77
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:46,400
Swish! The purple goes back into the rainbow!

78
00:09:46,500 --> 00:10:00,400
The rainbow is complete!

79
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:03,900
Hooray! We did it!

80
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:10,400
Hooray for Mipo and his friends!

81
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:20,400
Red, orange, yellow, green, blue... and purple!

82
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:30,400
Today I felt sad, then brave, then happy! And my friends helped me.

83
00:10:30,500 --> 00:10:40,400
Remember: it's okay to feel sad, friends help each other, and every color is important.

84
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:59,900
Thank you for helping me, friends! See you next magic moment!
